{"density":2.8125,"scaledDensity":2.8125,"fontScale":1,"texts":[{"text":"Story Outline & Characters Result","box":[45,-3280,990,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_header","window":0},{"text":"Story Outline","box":[90,-3155,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_label","window":0},{"text":"【Wrong Hands】\nClaire wakes up in a messy bedroom, shocked to discover she is looking at her own reflection as Leo.\n\n【The Hallway Encounter】\nStumbling into the school hallway, Claire in Leo's body runs into a classmate who treats her with unfamiliar, casual hostility.\n\n【Face to Face】\nClaire enters her own classroom and freezes upon seeing her adult body standing authoritatively at the chalkboard.\n\n【The Silent Interrogation】\nLeo corners Claire at the back desk during homeroom, demanding to know what kind of curse she placed on him.\n\n【A Forced Truce】\nClaire whispers instructions on how Leo must act as a teacher while Leo warns her about the impending principal inspection.\n\n【The Pop Quiz】\nLeo steps behind the teacher's podium and announces a surprise test designed to fail Claire in his body before she can intervene.\n\nPossible Characters:\n• Claire — Female lead, high school literature teacher trapped in Leo's body\n• Leo — Male lead, rebellious student piloting Claire's adult body\n• Marcus — Supporting character, aggressive high school classmate","box":[90,-3070,900,1892],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":36,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0},{"text":"Characters Result","box":[90,-1085,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_characters_label","window":0},{"text":"Claire","box":[90,-741,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0},{"text":"Leo","box":[372,-741,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0},{"text":"Marcus","box":[654,-741,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0},{"text":"Here's your storyboard","box":[45,-600,990,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_card_lead","window":0},{"text":"Storyboard Result","box":[90,-481,680,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_card_header","window":0},{"text":"View more","box":[770,-483,175,43],"color":"#FF49B9FF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_card_view_more","window":0},{"text":"Scene 1 — Wrong Hands","box":[263,-382,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Claire, occupying Leo's lean teenage body with messy black hair, stands frozen in front of a cracked wardrobe mirror in a cluttered bedroom lit by cool morning window light. His large hands are pressed flat against his cheeks, fingers spread wide, while his wide eyes stare directly at his own reflection.","box":[263,-316,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 2 — The Hallway Encounter","box":[263,-66,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"In a bright, fluorescent-lit school hallway crowded with lockers, Marcus leans aggressively over Claire in Leo's body, pinning him against a grey locker door with one braced arm. Claire stands rigidly upright, Leo's jaw set tight and eyes wide with defensive tension.","box":[263,0,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 3 — Face to Face","box":[263,250,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Inside a sunlit high school classroom, Claire's adult body stands behind the podium in a rust-orange cardigan and navy trousers, holding a piece of chalk with a mocking smirk. Down the center aisle, Claire in Leo's biker jacket stands motionless, staring forward in shock.","box":[263,316,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 4 — The Silent Interrogation","box":[263,566,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"At a back-corner wooden desk in the classroom, Leo in Claire's adult body leans forward with hands planted on the desktop, glaring down with furious intensity. Claire in Leo's teenage frame leans forward from the wooden chair, their faces barely two feet apart in tense confrontation.","box":[263,632,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 5 — A Forced Truce","box":[263,882,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"In the back corner of Classroom 3A, Leo in Claire's body turns away from the desk toward the front aisle, straightening the rust-orange cardigan with an insolent tilt of the chin. Claire in Leo's body remains seated, leaning forward with an urgent, watchful posture.","box":[263,948,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 6 — The Pop Quiz","box":[263,1198,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"At the rear of Classroom 3A, Claire stands stiffly upright in Leo's leather jacket beside her wooden desk, glaring down with rigid intensity. Leo, standing in Claire's cardigan and trousers, holds an exam paper flat against her desk, looking up into her eyes with an insolent, provocative smile.","box":[263,1264,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Storyboard Preview","box":[90,1539,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_header","window":0},{"text":"Body Swap","box":[361,1636,606,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_title","window":0},{"text":"0:58","box":[361,1679,606,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","fa